<title>FRANCE: Axa shares up ahead of Equitable earnings.</title>
<headline>Axa shares up ahead of Equitable earnings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French insurer Axa gained close to two percent on Monday on market speculation its 60.6 percent U.S. unit Equitable might release good earnings on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Axa is up thanks to Equitable. Everyone expects really good results,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>In 1995 Equitable contributed 1.55 billion francs to Axa's earnings.</p>
<p>Axa was up 1.90 percent to 380.4 francs at 1145 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
